---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Refund Department</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="refund-screen">
      <section class="refund-card">
        <div class="refund-head">
          <span>Refund Processing Unit</span>
          <span>no chance.exe</span>
        </div>

        <div class="refund-body">
          <p class="big-line">LOOK AT YOU.</p>
          <p class="big-line">YOU REALLY PULLED UP</p>
          <p class="big-line">ASKING FOR A REFUND</p>
          <p class="big-line">ON A DEGEN MINT PAGE.</p>

          <p class="mid-copy">
            My dear citizen of bad decisions, you saw the chaos, ignored every warning,
            clicked every shiny button, and still expected a customer success department.
          </p>
          <p class="mid-copy">
            That is not confidence. That is elite, hall-of-fame, museum-grade naivety.
          </p>
          <p class="mid-copy">
            The committee reviewed your case for seven dramatic seconds and concluded:
            you got cooked by your own optimism.
          </p>

          <a href="/mint" class="mint-btn">MINT PONZILIO FELLAS</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255, 214, 77, 0.18), transparent 26%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #17120d 0%, #090909 100%);
    color: #ffe96b;
    font-family: Verdana, Geneva, Tahoma, sans-serif;
  }

  .refund-screen {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .refund-card {
    width: min(880px, 100%);
    background: #111;
    border: 3px solid;
    border-color: #fff4be #5a3a00 #5a3a00 #fff4be;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;
  }

  .refund-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffd24a 0%, #d08700 100%);
    color: #000;
    font-family: "Press Start 2P", monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .refund-body {
    padding: 34px 28px 30px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .big-line {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-family: "VT323", monospace;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 233, 107, 0.18);
  }

  .mid-copy {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    color: #f4df9e;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .mint-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 30px;
    min-height: 62px;
    padding: 0 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3b6dd8 0%, #0a2a6b 100%);
    border: 3px solid;
    border-color: #a8c0e8 #02143a #02143a #a8c0e8;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: "Press Start 2P", monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000;
    box-shadow: inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.3), 0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }

  .mint-btn:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .refund-head {
      font-size: 8px;
    }

    .mid-copy {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .mint-btn {
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 14px 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
